  "dcterms:description": "CPDat (Chemical and Products Database) maps more than 49,000 chemicals to usage/function terms and to ~16,000 consumer-product types, and is part of EPA's CompTox (CompTox Chemicals Dashboard) program. The brick downloads a CPDat release (CPDatRelease20201216.zip) from EPA's public gaftp server; the dataset of record is published on EPA's figshare (article 5352997, DOI 10.23645/epacomptox.5352997) under CC0.",
